        "title": "Dr. Robotnik's Theme",
        "text": "The boss theme of Sonic the Hedgehog 2 (Sega, 1992) plays when Sonic fights Dr. Robotnik at the end of a zone. In Sega's own list it is just called \"Boss\", and VGMPF lists it at 1 minute 22 seconds."
      },
      {
        "title": "Legendary melodies",
        "text": "In the Sonic Stadium Soundtrack Squad Review (2010), the reviewer JezMM said: \"the boss themes of 16-bit version have become legendary melodies\"."
      }
    ]
